 "creditTransfers": {
  "_doc": "A fund credit (negative balance / prepayment) applied to OTHER funds' dues. The balance rises back to 0, but it is NOT a charge (nothing billed) and NOT a forgiveness — it is a reconciliation (reconciliere-numerar). Booked as an owed-adjustment on the source fund; the counterpart payments already exist in the source (the other funds' Platit). Confirmed with admin per case.",
